#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/interface/menu_bar.rst:7
msgid ""
"The menu bar is placed at top from element editor window. The element editor"
" contains the menus ``File``, ``Edit``, ``Display``, ``Settings``, and "
"``Help``. Each menu provides many different options."
